I added a `__builtin_expect` branch hint so the compiler lays out the common valid-field path as fall-through, avoiding the cold `return 1` branch in the hot loop.

```cpp
FIT_FLOAT64 Field::GetScale() const
{
    if (__builtin_expect((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields), 0))
        return 1;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].scale;
}
```